1	2	cover	Dear Hiring Manager,\n\nI am excited about the Backend Developer position at Lithium Urban Technologies and believe my experience aligns well with your requirements. At Tapza, I worked extensively with Node.js and Express to develop tenant-aware APIs for billing, inventory management, purchases, subscriptions, and pharmacy operations. This role required me to implement asynchronous background processing using BullMQ and Redis, ensuring efficient handling of subscription management and payment integrations with Stripe.\n\nMy experience at Infosys SpringBoard as a Java Developer Intern also honed my skills in backend development using REST APIs and contributed to effective Scrum Master practices during development sprints.\n\nI am particularly drawn to Lithium Urban Technologies because of your commitment to innovation and sustainable solutions. I look forward to contributing my expertise in building robust, scalable systems that can support complex operations.\n\nThank you for considering my application. I am eager to discuss how my background aligns with the needs of your team.\n\nSincerely,\n[Your Name]	draft	2026-07-01 11:09:20.031768+00
